{"issues":[{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"531901","self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/531901","key":"MC-307782","renderedFields":{"summary":null,"issuetype":null,"watches":null,"customfield_10070":null,"customfield_10061":"","created":"28/Apr/26 7:33 AM","customfield_10050":"1611105","customfield_10051":null,"description":"<h3><a name=\"TheBug%3A\"></a><b>The Bug:</b></h3>\n\n<p>Sulfur spring geysers can push players in creative mode who are flying.</p>\n\n<p>Players who are in creative mode and are flying are normally immune to being pushed by blocks. This is not the case with sulfur spring geysers.</p>\n\n<h3><a name=\"StepstoReproduce%3A\"></a><b>Steps to Reproduce:</b></h3>\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>Construct a sulfur spring geyser and begin flying above it.</li>\n\t<li>Wait for the geyser to activate and observe how you are pushed despite flying in creative mode.</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n<h3><a name=\"ObservedBehavior%3A\"></a><b>Observed Behavior:</b></h3>\n\n<p>Sulfur spring geysers can push players in creative mode who are flying.</p>\n\n<h3><a name=\"ExpectedBehavior%3A\"></a><b>Expected Behavior:</b></h3>\n\n<p>Sulfur spring geysers would not be able to push players in creative mode who are flying.</p>","customfield_10054":null,"customfield_10055":null,"fixVersions":null,"resolution":null,"customfield_10047":null,"labels":null,"customfield_10048":null,"customfield_10049":null,"attachment":[],"versions":null,"resolutiondate":"04/May/26 3:42 AM","issuelinks":null,"updated":"04/May/26 3:42 AM","status":null},"fields":{"summary":"Sulfur spring geysers can push players in Creative mode who are flying","issuetype":{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issuetype/10006","id":"10006","description":"A problem which impairs or prevents the functions of the product. (Migrated on 23 Jan 2025 19:08 UTC)","iconUrl":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/